# Test fixture for the client tests: compile with 'bever compile test/fixture/bev --output test/fixture/model.json'.
Identity

Entity Category
    Field Name Text(80)

Entity Product
    Field Name Text(120)
    Field Price Money
    Field InStock Boolean = True
    Field Category -> Category?
    Field Owner -> Identity?
    Field Website Url?
    Field ReleasedOn Date?
    Field Notes Text(2000)?
    Rule Price >= 0 "Price cannot be negative"

    Present
        Listing
            Fields Name, Price, Category, InStock
        Editing
            Mode Inline
            Fields Name, Price, Category

Action Read Category
    By Anyone

Action Crud Product
    By Authenticated

Role Manager
Role Buyer

Entity Supplier
    Field Name Text(80)

Action Read Supplier
    By Manager
